{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>GUMBRAWL</strong>, the galaxy\u2019s favourite competitive obstacle course, at least according to our marketing department and one very defensive intern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/31bda340d750d13352ea6256f7d3f4f5.poster.avif?t=1771853297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/31bda340d750d13352ea6256f7d3f4f5.webm?t=1771853297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>PRESENTED TO YOU BY LUDENS LABS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, bash, and blunder <i>in first person</i> through a series of formidable minigames where everything is scientifically designed to go as poorly for you as possible. Up to four players compete across ever-shifting courses packed with traps, gadgets, and the occasional \u201csafety feature\u201d that seems oddly carnivorous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tokens by surviving (or at least being entertaining while not doing so). Spend them between rounds to upgrade your loadout: grapple hooks, cluster grenades, jet belts, boomerangs, the kind of equipment that makes our health and safety officers quietly sob in the break room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/42660aea3571eaf8d0d3660a563dbbd8.poster.avif?t=1771853297\" width=64 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/42660aea3571eaf8d0d3660a563dbbd8.webm?t=1771853297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every course is hand-crafted to offer that signature <strong>Gumbrawl-brand zest of peril</strong>: conveyor belts over pits, collapsing bridges, cannons that promote spontaneous re-evaluation of life choices. Spectators adore it. You probably won\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for glory, chaos, and the promise of prize money that may or may not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the lights and laughter, something\u2019s humming in the walls, but we ask you to politely refrain from asking questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/6b82c4d6b3cfb4894b47b89f4d74b417.webp?t=1771853297\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/6b82c4d6b3cfb4894b47b89f4d74b417.poster.avif?t=1771853297\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stop asking about that prize money too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1240920?t=1771853297","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/e3fc9542ae4cbc9193f06e6a756f336e88b5b5c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771853297","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it