rnivorous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tokens by surviving (or at least being entertaining while not doing so). Spend them between rounds to upgrade your loadout: grapple hooks, cluster grenades, jet belts, boomerangs, the kind of equipment that makes our health and safety officers quietly sob in the break room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/42660aea3571eaf8d0d3660a563dbbd8.poster.avif?t=1771853297\" width=64 height=38 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/42660aea3571eaf8d0d3660a563dbbd8.webm?t=1771853297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every course is hand-crafted to offer that signature <strong>Gumbrawl-brand zest of peril</strong>: conveyor belts over pits, collapsing bridges, cannons that promote spontaneous re-evaluation of life choices. Spectators adore it. You probably won\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for glory, chaos, and the promise of prize money that may or may not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the lights and laughter, something\u2019s humming in the walls, but we ask you to politely refrain from asking questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/6b82c4d6b3cfb4894b47b89f4d74b417.webp?t=1771853297\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/extras/6b82c4d6b3cfb4894b47b89f4d74b417.poster.avif?t=1771853297\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stop asking about that prize money too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["updog"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1240920/d0dab3471ed9ec971fc7b19d9f399197bf22710b/header.jpg?t=1771853297","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15 Sequoia or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15 Sequoia or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 Pro</li></ul>"},"name":"Gumbrawl","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Dual Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 500 series or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</str